de> and <code>total_pages</code> helpers<br> <li> <code>chunked</code> validates <code>size > 0</code> and slices items<br> <li> off-by-one: loop step is <code>size + 1</code>, skipping items<br> <li> <code>total_pages</code> returns <code>len(chunked(...))</code></ul>\n\n\n</details>\n\n\n  </td>\n  <td><a href=\"https://github.com/m0nklabs/pr-piet-test/pull/23/files#diff-7f3fe11aed91ed3848811aa0c999996e0577784f2ad9cec06c6667789f9ae9a9\">+23/-0</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; </td>\n\n</tr>\n</table></td></tr></tr></tbody></table>\n\n</details>\n\n___"}, "file": {"name": "git_provider.py", "path": "/app/pr_agent/git_providers/git_provider.py"}, "function": "get_user_description", "level": {"icon": "🐞", "name": "DEBUG", "no": 10}, "line": 473, "message": "Existing description", "module": "git_provider", "name": "pr_agent.git_providers.git_provider", "process": {"id": 7, "name": "MainProcess"}, "thread": {"id": 136200000320384, "name": "MainThread"}, "time": {"repr": "2026-10-04 15:45:10.060155+00:00", "timestamp": 1791128710.060155}}}
